@startuml F8.2-D03-rate-limit-ticket
title F8.2-D03 — Rate limit ao abrir ticket
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Usuario" as User
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RequestController" as Ctrl
participant "RateLimiter" as RL

User -> WebApp: envia ticket
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /requests
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> RL: check janela
RL --> Ctrl: excedido
Ctrl --> WebApp: 429 rate-limit
WebApp --> User: aguarde e tente de novo

@enduml
